B.a0o=s(["Verimi d\xfc\u015fm\xfc\u015f bir tarla veya mera karosuna dokunun.","Alt paneldeki Toprak Sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xe7ubu\u011funu inceleyin.","Nadasa alarak topra\u011f\u0131n dinlenmesini sa\u011flay\u0131n; doldu\u011funda tekrar \xfcretime a\xe7\u0131n."],t.s)
B.ZZ=s(["Tap an exhausted farm or pasture hex.","Check the Soil Health gauge in the action sheet.","Switch to Rest mode to regenerate soil and trigger the Respiration Burst."],t.s)
B.a_W=s(["Tarlalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 mevsim d\xf6n\xfc\u015flerinde s\u0131rayla nadasa b\u0131rakarak k\u0131\u015f \xf6ncesi stok patlamas\u0131 yarat\u0131n."],t.s)
